    "premise": "On a spring trip to the fishing lakes, a girl helps her grandfather build a snow house for the night. She wants to go fast and her blocks crack; he shows her how to find the right snow, cut each block, lean it on the last one and set the final block at the top, and she sleeps warm inside what she helped build.",
